  "description": "Story-1 is reviewed on Tuesday, and Wednesday's brown-paint opens the related story-1+1, which supersedes it. An application process then records story-2 for the same disagreement, citing the same Wednesday evidence and relating it to story-1 as story-1+1 does, so story-1+1 and story-2 both begin at 09:00 on Wednesday and no story of the family began after them. Neither is chosen as the latest: both are listed among the ambiguous entries, story-1 is superseded, and nothing is counted. Pending review lists the tied stories as ambiguous and no superseded story, since story-1 is reviewed. Each story keeps its own standing, and an earlier frame is unchanged.",
